"""
AI Research Assistant Agent
===========================
Single-file system for Recruitbots AI — Agentic AI Engineer Challenge 1.

An autonomous research agent that reasons iteratively, selects tools at runtime,
collects evidence from multiple sources, cites references, and emits structured
reports. Workflow is not hardcoded: each turn the model (or deterministic planner)
chooses which tool to call next until it stops with a final report.

Tools (4):
  web_search        — keyword search over a curated web index
  fetch_source      — load full text for a known source id or URL key
  knowledge_lookup  — search an internal knowledge base
  note_taking       — write / read working notes (multi-step context)

Constraints addressed:
  tool calling, iterative reasoning, no fixed pipeline, session context,
  ambiguous-request clarification, structured reports with citations.
Customer-facing report text carries no machine-origin labels.
"""

